   "title": "Chinese envoy warns US-Korea alliance shouldn't become 'tool' against China",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/20261127/chinese-envoy-warns-us-korea-alliance-shouldnt-become-tool-against-china",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
