   "title": "Parliamentary committee adopts confirmation hearing report for justice minister nominee",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/politics/20261127/parliamentary-committee-adopts-confirmation-hearing-report-for-justice-minister-nominee",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
