   "title": "Defense minister visits Army's drone testing unit amid push for unmanned systems",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/defense/20261127/defense-minister-visits-armys-drone-testing-unit-amid-push-for-unmanned-systems",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
