   "_dt": 1795790823.0,
   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "South Koreans' overseas card spending hit the highest-ever amount in the third quarter of the year on the back of an increase in outbound travelers, data showed Friday. The amount of money spent overseas by South Koreans with credit and debit cards came to $6.63 billion in the July-September period, up 13.3 percent from three months earlier, according to data from the Bank of Korea (BOK). The central bank said more South Koreans traveled overseas, although direct purchases from abroad declined.",
   "summary_zh": "数据显示，受出境旅客增加带动，韩国人在海外使用银行卡消费的金额于今年第三季度创下历史最高纪录。根据韩国银行（BOK）的数据，韩国人在7月至9月期间通过信用卡和借记卡在海外消费的金额达到66.3亿美元，较三个月前增长13.3%。该央行表示，出境旅行的韩国人有所增加，但在海外直接购买商品的数量有所下降。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "South Koreans' overseas card spending hit the highest-ever amount in the third quarter of the year on the back of an increase in outbound travelers, data showed Friday. The amount of money spent overseas by South Koreans with credit and debit cards came to $6.63 billion in the July-September period, up 13.3 percent from three months earlier, according to data from the Bank of Korea (BOK). The on-quarter rise marks the sharpest since the first quarter of 2023, when the reading spiked 14.8 percent, and also is the largest-ever. The central bank said more South Koreans traveled overseas, although direct purchases from abroad declined. The number of overseas travelers came to 7.12 million in the third quarter of the year, up 7.4 percent from the previous quarter. The combined amount of purchases made through overseas shopping malls, on the other hand, fell 0.8 percent to $1.4 billion",
