   "_dt": 1795790823.0,
   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "The number has been dropping since the second half of 2024, the KMCC said. By company, KT accounted for the most with 25.39 percent, followed by SK Broadband with 18.67 percent and LG Uplus with 15.96 percent. The three companies are major fixed-line operators in South Korea.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国移动通信委员会表示，这一数字自2024年下半年以来一直在下降。按公司划分，KT占比最高，为25.39%；其次是SK Broadband，占18.67%；LG Uplus占15.96%。这三家公司是韩国主要固定电话运营商。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The number has been dropping since the second half of 2024, the KMCC said. By company, KT accounted for the most with 25.39 percent, followed by SK Broadband with 18.67 percent and LG Uplus with 15.96 percent. The three companies are major fixed-line operators in South Korea. The media watchdog said it will continue to monitor market trends and devise measures to improve the sustainability of the broadcasting and media industry in the face of advanced digital technologies and artificial intelligence (AI)",
