   "title": "US too focused on Middle East and not pushing Russia hard enough, Zelensky",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/us-too-focused-on-middle-east-and-not-pushing-russia-hard-enough-zelensky/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
   "source": "MyJoyOnline（加纳）",
