   "title": "US proposes excess capacity tariffs on Korean goods within agreed 15% ceiling",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/20261126/us-proposes-excess-capacity-tariffs-on-korean-goods-within-agreed-15-ceiling",
