   "title": "N. Korea's Yongbyon nuclear complex expansion may boost weapons-grade uranium production, says US science institute",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/northkorea/20261125/n-koreas-yongbyon-nuclear-complex-expansion-may-boost-weapons-grade-uranium-production-says-us-science-institute",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
